The orchestration and delegation skills originated in this repository and
include updates from herdrpowers, Copyright (c) 2026 transparent-pegasus,
distributed there under MIT at commit 7253d0f and, most recently, 1921c31:
its composition profiles, decision-maker brief, agent lifecycle helper, and
their tests. The herdr guide bootstrap uses the same method as 7253d0f. No
Superpowers skills or source are included.

Herdr is an external runtime dependency. Its upstream skill, README, and
implementation are not bundled. The installed CLI supplies its own guide
with herdr --skill. This change applies to the current distribution; earlier
snapshots that bundled Herdr material keep their original Apache-2.0 terms.
